---
import UnionCaseLayout from '../../../layouts/UnionCaseLayout.astro';
const visuals=[
 {src:'https://static.tildacdn.com/tild6636-3062-4362-b539-666636643839/__-min.png',alt:'Union Klinika website shown on laptop',label:'DESKTOP / HOMEPAGE'},
 {src:'https://static.tildacdn.com/tild3763-6632-4338-a137-353237366334/Slide_16_9_-_69-min.jpg',alt:'Union Klinika website page design overview',label:'PAGE SYSTEM / DESKTOP'},
 {src:'https://static.tildacdn.com/tild3030-3966-4330-b035-653034613134/Slide_16_9_-_67-min.jpg',alt:'Union Klinika mobile website screens',label:'MOBILE / SERVICES / DOCTORS'}
];
---
<UnionCaseLayout title="Union Klinika — website" description="How RM CREATIVES redesigned Union Klinika's patient-facing website around clarity, trust and appointment conversion." eyebrow="WEBSITE" headline="A clinic website" accent="built for patients." intro="We rebuilt Union Klinika's website around the things a patient actually needs: services, doctors, trust, useful information and a clear path to appointment." metrics={[{value:'NEW',label:'website rebuild'},{value:'LV / RU',label:'patient-facing languages'},{value:'UX',label:'navigation + appointment path'},{value:'RM',label:'strategy + design + build'}]}>
<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">THE BRIEF</span><div><h2>Maximum clarity.<br/>Without an<br/>oversized build.</h2><p class="statement">The goal was to improve patient interaction while working within a limited website budget.</p><p>We took a phased approach: modernise the visual language, make navigation more logical, make doctors and services easier to understand and reduce friction on the way to an appointment. The website became the destination that paid acquisition could confidently send patients to.</p></div></div></section>

<section class="gallery"><div class="shell"><div class="gallery-head"><span class="eyebrow">THE ACTUAL WORK / UNION KLINIKA</span><div><h2>Not a mockup.<br/><em>The website we built.</em></h2><p>These are real project visuals from the original Union Klinika website case — desktop composition, the page system and mobile patient journeys.</p></div></div><div class="hero-shot"><span class="eyebrow">{visuals[0].label}</span><img src={visuals[0].src} alt={visuals[0].alt}/></div><div class="full-shot"><span class="eyebrow">{visuals[1].label}</span><img src={visuals[1].src} alt={visuals[1].alt} loading="lazy"/></div><div class="full-shot mobile-shot"><span class="eyebrow">{visuals[2].label}</span><img src={visuals[2].src} alt={visuals[2].alt} loading="lazy"/></div><p class="source-note">Original project presentation visuals. The live website has evolved since the project was first published.</p></div></section>

<section class="case-section shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT CHANGED</span><div><h2>Design was only<br/>one part of it.</h2><div class="rows light"><div class="row"><span>01</span><span>Modernised the visual language to make the clinic feel professional and reassuring.</span><strong>DESIGN</strong></div><div class="row"><span>02</span><span>Reworked the information architecture so patients could find services and doctors faster.</span><strong>STRUCTURE</strong></div><div class="row"><span>03</span><span>Added clearer service and doctor information to answer questions before contact.</span><strong>TRUST</strong></div><div class="row"><span>04</span><span>Simplified the appointment path and reduced unnecessary steps.</span><strong>CONVERSION</strong></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="case-section dark"><div class="shell"><div class="two"><span class="eyebrow">PATIENT JOURNEY</span><div><h2>From question<br/>to appointment.</h2><p class="statement">A medical website has to help a person make a decision, not just look polished.</p><div class="journey"><div><b>01</b><span>Understand the clinic</span><small>POSITIONING</small></div><div><b>02</b><span>Find a service</span><small>NAVIGATION</small></div><div><b>03</b><span>Meet the doctor</span><small>TRUST</small></div><div><b>04</b><span>Book the visit</span><small>ACTION</small></div></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="live"><div class="shell"><div class="live-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">LIVE TODAY</span><h2>The website is<br/>still doing its job.</h2><p>The current Union Klinika website remains live. Its content has changed over time, but the project continues to function as the clinic's patient-facing digital destination.</p><a href="https://unionklinika.lv/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OPEN UNIONKLINIKA.LV ↗</a></div><div class="mini-browser"><div><span>● ● ●</span><b>unionklinika.lv</b></div><img src="https://static.tildacdn.com/tild3763-6632-4338-a137-353237366334/Slide_16_9_-_69-min.jpg" alt="Union Klinika website project" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></section>

<section class="accent-section"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">THE RESULT</span><h2>A better website.<br/>A shorter path<br/>to the clinic.</h2><div class="flow"><span>ADS / SEARCH</span><b>→</b><span>WEBSITE</span><b>→</b><span>SERVICE</span><b>→</b><span>DOCTOR</span><b>→</b><span>APPOINTMENT</span></div></div></section>

<style>
.gallery{background:#e5e4de;padding:130px 0}.gallery-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.45fr 1.3fr;gap:80px;margin-bottom:75px}.gallery-head h2,.live h2{font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,100px);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:0}.gallery-head h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.gallery-head p,.live p{max-width:620px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#6d6d68}.hero-shot,.full-shot{position:relative;margin-bottom:12px;background:#111;overflow:hidden}.hero-shot{min-height:700px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:60px}.hero-shot img{width:min(100%,1100px);display:block}.hero-shot>span,.full-shot>span{position:absolute;z-index:2;top:20px;left:20px;background:#f8f8f4;padding:9px 11px}.full-shot img{width:100%;display:block}.source-note{font:10px monospace;color:#777;margin-top:16px}.light{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.light .row{border-color:var(--line)}.journey{margin-top:60px;border-top:1px solid #333}.journey>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr auto;gap:20px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #333;align-items:center}.journey b,.journey small{font:10px monospace}.journey span{font-size:20px}.live{padding:130px 0}.live-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:80px;align-items:center}.live a{display:inline-block;margin-top:25px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--white);padding:15px 18px;font:10px monospace}.mini-browser{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}.mini-browser>div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:9px monospace}.mini-browser img{width:100%;display:block}@media(max-width:800px){.gallery-head,.live-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gallery{padding:90px 0}.hero-shot{min-height:0;padding:35px 15px}.hero-shot>span,.full-shot>span{top:10px;left:10px}.journey>div{grid-template-columns:35px 1fr}.journey small{grid-column:2}.mobile-shot img{min-height:320px;object-fit:cover}}
</style>
</UnionCaseLayout>